      "control_name": "No FULL_CONTROL ACL Grants to Public",
      "control_description": "S3 bucket ACLs must not grant FULL_CONTROL to AllUsers or AuthenticatedUsers. FULL_CONTROL is the worst-case ACL misconfiguration — the grantee can read, write, and delete objects and modify the ACL itself.\n",
